comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T11:50:14.103Z",codex-sol,"Oriented real tracker and CI; no open Dependabot PRs or security alerts. Refresh CLI/SDK, pm-ops and pm-changelog exact published pins; preserve peer floor and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED release job guard. The only shipped command is offline ado validate; dogfood must not claim live Azure sync/import/export acceptance. Inspect ignored statement threshold and record its honest measured scope."
  "2026-10-04T11:52:54.738Z",codex-sol,"Test-first canonical launcher refresh: real invalid NODE_PATH file fixture fails old launcher (ENOTDIR replaces original MODULE_NOT_FOUND), then installed pm-ops 2026.10.4 template copied byte-for-byte makes launcher suite pass 8/8. No template edits or new skips. Independent statement threshold is declared but not consumed by the Node V8 gate; record a quality follow-up and report three measured dimensions honestly."
  "2026-10-04T11:57:56.517Z",codex-sol,"Local CI gates, clean audits, packed offline npm/Bun validation and strict health pass; statement enforcement remains a known pre-existing gap in pm-ado-5w3m. Evidence committed with code; release remains owner gated and no Azure writes or publishing. Releasing claim for orchestrator without closing; review final pushed head separately."
  "2026-10-04T12:10:51.436Z",codex-sol,"Review round 1: generated installed pm-github distribution is clone-local and excluded from Git to keep consumer review focused on authored changes. Exact local managed install and zero-case dry-run command/receipt remain in certification docs. Owner publishing gate and statement-coverage follow-up remain unchanged. Initial Node 22/26 CI passed; final-head CI and substantive review receipts remain separate."
  "2026-10-15T17:57:20.117Z",codex-agent,"The 2026.10.4 certification target is obsolete: the current main package pins PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.12 and includes merged PR #25. New command acceptance is tracked separately under the sync epic; this item remains open as requested."
